## 1️⃣ Premium‑Economy Flights (Best value & fastest)

| # | Airline (operated by) | Outbound – 15 Nov | Return – 22 Nov | Flight time | Stops | Premium‑Economy fare* |
|---|-----------------------|-------------------|-----------------|------------|-------|-----------------------|
